 "popupdata": "<div id=\"tw-event-dialog-3949\" style=\"width: 640px;\" class=\"tw-cal-event-popup\">\n <div>\n <div class=\"cal-pop-col30\">\n <div class=\"tw-event-image-cal-pop\">\n <a role=\"link\" title=\"Event Image\" aria-label=\"Event Image\" href=\"https://myparktheatre.com/tm-event/cantor-dust-the-anatomy-of-malevolence-album-release-show/\">\n <img src=\"https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/13/61/14/13_Original.jpg?v=5\">\n </a>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"cal-pop-col70\">\n <div class=\"tw-name\">\n <a role=\"link\" title=\"Cantor Dust: The Anatomy of Malevolence: Album Release Show\" aria-label=\"Cantor Dust: The Anatomy of Malevolence: Album Release Show\" style=\"\" href=\"https://myparktheatre.com/tm-event/cantor-dust-the-anatomy-of-malevolence-album-release-show/\">Cantor Dust: The Anatomy of Malevolence: Album Release Show</a>\n </div>\n <div class=\"tw-attractions\">\n with <span>Cantor Dust</span>, <span>Luana Moth</span>, <span>Juniper Moon</span> </div>\n <div class=\"tw-venue-name\">\n </div>\n <div class=\"tw-date-time\">\n <span class=\"tw-event-date-complete\"><span class=\"tw-event-date\">October 02, 2026</span></span>\n <span class=\"tw-event-time-complete\">8:30 PM</span>\n <span class=\"tw-event-timezone\">CDT</span>\n <span class=\"tw-event-door-time-complete\">(Doors: <span class=\"tw-event-door-time\">7:30 PM</span>)</span>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"cal-pop-colfull\">\n <hr />\n <div class=\"tw-description\">\n <p>Winnipeg experimental rock quartet Cantor Dust celebrates the release of their new album, The Anatomy of Malevolence, on Friday, October 2, 2026 at the Park Theatre. Following the college-radio success of Too Many Stars, Cantor Dust returns with their most emotionally resonant and ambitious work yet, blending experimental rock with cello, saxophone, percussion, piano, and synthesizers. With special guests Luana Moth and Juniper Moon. An immersive night of adventurous, genre-defying music featuring three of Winnipeg&rsqu